<title>USA: Baxter names CFO Kraemer as president.</title>
<headline>Baxter names CFO Kraemer as president.</headline>
<dateline>DEERFIELD, Ill. 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Baxter International Inc said Monday its board had elected Chief Financial Officer Harry Kraemer to the post of president, effective immediately.  </p>
<p>The president's post at Baxter has been vacant for several years.</p>
<p>A search is under way for a new chief financial officer, the company said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
